{"id":"98740325086ed05c","group":"28","path":"28/28-thm-chebyshev-inequality.md","title":"Chebyshev 方差尾界","display":"thm-chebyshev-inequality — Chebyshev 方差尾界","type":"theorem","metadata":{"type":"theorem","book":"Computational Complexity: A Modern Approach","book_abbrev":"28","label":"28-thm-chebyshev-inequality","aliases":["28-thm-chebyshev-inequality"],"display":"thm-chebyshev-inequality — Chebyshev 方差尾界","depends_on":["[[28-thm-markov-inequality]]"],"source_book_location":"Lemma A.12","source_printed_pages":"514","source_pdf_pages":"540","source_status":"statement-compared-local-formalization","source_proof_reviewed":false,"local_proof_reviewed":true,"eligible_as_verified_dependency":true,"revision":"R5","verification_status":"proved-in-note; source-statement-compared"},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"theorem"},{"key":"book","html":"Computational Complexity: A Modern Approach"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"28"},{"key":"label","html":"28-thm-chebyshev-inequality"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>28-thm-chebyshev-inequality</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"thm-chebyshev-inequality — Chebyshev 方差尾界"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"353a7908c18727ad\" href=\"?note=353a7908c18727ad\" title=\"28-thm-markov-inequality\">28-thm-markov-inequality</a></span></div>"},{"key":"source_book_location","html":"Lemma A.12"},{"key":"source_printed_pages","html":"514"},{"key":"source_pdf_pages","html":"540"},{"key":"source_status","html":"statement-compared-local-formalization"},{"key":"source_proof_reviewed","html":"false"},{"key":"local_proof_reviewed","html":"true"},{"key":"eligible_as_verified_dependency","html":"true"},{"key":"revision","html":"R5"},{"key":"verification_status","html":"proved-in-note; source-statement-compared"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\Omega\">\\(\\Omega\\)</span> 有限非空，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"p:\\Omega\\to[0,1]\">\\(p:\\Omega\\to[0,1]\\)</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\sum_{\\omega\\in\\Omega}p(\\omega)=1\">\\(\\sum_{\\omega\\in\\Omega}p(\\omega)=1\\)</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"X:\\Omega\\to\\mathbb R\">\\(X:\\Omega\\to\\mathbb R\\)</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mu=\\sum_{\\omega\\in\\Omega}p(\\omega)X(\\omega)\">\\(\\mu=\\sum_{\\omega\\in\\Omega}p(\\omega)X(\\omega)\\)</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\sigma=\\left(\\sum_{\\omega\\in\\Omega}p(\\omega)(X(\\omega)-\\mu)^2\\right)^{1/2}\">\\(\\sigma=\\left(\\sum_{\\omega\\in\\Omega}p(\\omega)(X(\\omega)-\\mu)^2\\right)^{1/2}\\)</span>；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"a\\in\\mathbb R_{&gt;0}\">\\(a\\in\\mathbb R_{&gt;0}\\)</span>。<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\Pr_p[X\\in B]=\\sum_{\\omega\\in\\Omega:X(\\omega)\\in B}p(\\omega)\">\\(\\Pr_p[X\\in B]=\\sum_{\\omega\\in\\Omega:X(\\omega)\\in B}p(\\omega)\\)</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"B\\subseteq\\mathbb R\">\\(B\\subseteq\\mathbb R\\)</span>。</p>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\Pr_p[|X-\\mu|\\ge a]\\le\\frac{\\sigma^2}{a^2}.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\Pr_p[|X-\\mu|\\ge a]\\le\\frac{\\sigma^2}{a^2}.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\sigma&gt;0\\Longrightarrow\\forall k\\in\\mathbb R_{&gt;0}\\quad\\Pr_p[|X-\\mu|\\ge k\\sigma]\\le k^{-2}.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\sigma&gt;0\\Longrightarrow\\forall k\\in\\mathbb R_{&gt;0}\\quad\\Pr_p[|X-\\mu|\\ge k\\sigma]\\le k^{-2}.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>证明：非负随机量 Y=(X−μ)² 的期望为 σ²，直接用 Markov 阈值 a²。σ=0 时 X=μ 几乎处处，第一式仍成立；第二式显式排除零标准差，从而不因非严格尾事件引入退化错误。</p>\n<p>来源：所给 Arora–Barak PDF，Lemma A.12；印刷页 514；PDF 页 540。</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"28-thm-markov-inequality","status":"resolved","id":"353a7908c18727ad","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[28-thm-markov-inequality]]","embed":false}],"attachments":[],"math":[{"tex":"\\Omega","display":false},{"tex":"p:\\Omega\\to[0,1]","display":false},{"tex":"\\sum_{\\omega\\in\\Omega}p(\\omega)=1","display":false},{"tex":"X:\\Omega\\to\\mathbb R","display":false},{"tex":"\\mu=\\sum_{\\omega\\in\\Omega}p(\\omega)X(\\omega)","display":false},{"tex":"\\sigma=\\left(\\sum_{\\omega\\in\\Omega}p(\\omega)(X(\\omega)-\\mu)^2\\right)^{1/2}","display":false},{"tex":"a\\in\\mathbb R_{>0}","display":false},{"tex":"\\Pr_p[X\\in B]=\\sum_{\\omega\\in\\Omega:X(\\omega)\\in B}p(\\omega)","display":false},{"tex":"B\\subseteq\\mathbb R","display":false},{"tex":"\\Pr_p[|X-\\mu|\\ge a]\\le\\frac{\\sigma^2}{a^2}.","display":true},{"tex":"\\sigma>0\\Longrightarrow\\forall k\\in\\mathbb R_{>0}\\quad\\Pr_p[|X-\\mu|\\ge k\\sigma]\\le k^{-2}.","display":true}],"bytes":1501,"backlinks":[{"id":"61dee9752dab3b61","anchor":"ref-422","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[28-lem-probabilistic-method]]、[[28-thm-markov-inequality]]、[[28-thm-chebyshev-inequality]]、[[28-prop-pairwise-independent-variance]]。"}],"outgoing":["353a7908c18727ad"]}